                            <a id="hyperOtherDoc" target="_blank" href="@(string.IsNullOrEmpty(Model.OTHER_DOC_FILE)?"#":"../../Uploads/CustomerMaster/"+Model.OTHER_DOC_FILE)">@Model.OTHER_DOC_FILE</a>
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                </table>


                <!-- Requester Details -->
                <table class="tableView tablepadding" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
                    <tr>
                        <td class="HeaderStyle12" colspan="4">&nbsp;Requester Details</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr class="row1">
                        <td width="20%" class="collvlstyle">ID :-</td>
                        <td width="30%">
                            <label id="lblRequesterID">@(Model.REQUESTERDETAILS.requesterid)</label>
                        </td>
                        <td width="20%" class="collvlstyle">Name :-</td>
                        <td width="30%">
                            <label id="lblRequesterName">@Model.REQUESTERDETAILS.ENAME</label>
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr class="row2">
                        <td width="20%" class="collvlstyle">Email ID :-</td>
                        <td width="30%">
                            <label id="lblEmailID">@Model.REQUESTERDETAILS.EMAILID</label>
                        </td>
                        <td width="20%" class="collvlstyle">Mobile No. :-</td>
                        <td width="30%">
                            <label id="lblMobileNo">@Model.REQUESTERDETAILS.TMOBILE</label>
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                </table>
            }

            <table class="table table-bordered table-condensed table-striped" style="margin-bottom:2px; width:100%;">
                <tr>
                    <td class="HeaderStyle12" colspan="2">Request Remarks</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td class="collvlstyle">Remarks :-</td>
                    <td colspan="3">

                        <span id="lblremark" class="lblcss">@Model.REMARKS</span>
                    </td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td class="HeaderStyle12" colspan="2">Approval Detail</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td class="collvlstyle" width="20%">Status :-</td>
                    <td width="80%">

                        <select id="ddlstatus" class="swiftselect" style="width:180px">
                            <option value="" selected>-Select-</option>
                            <option value="1">Approve</option>
                            <option value="0">Reject</option>
                            <option value="2">Send Back</option>

                        </select>
                    </td>
                </tr>

                <tr>
                    <td class="collvlstyle" style="padding:1px">Remarks :-</td>
                    <td>
                        <textarea id="txt_Remarks"
                                  class="txtmultiline"
                                  maxlength="499"
                                  onkeypress="return (this.value.length < 499);"
                                  onpaste="return false">
                    </textarea>

                    </td>
                </tr>
                <tr id="tr_chkmatch">
                    <td colspan="2" class="disclaimer">
                        <input type="checkbox" id="chk_match" class="chkdeclaration" />
                        I have verified that match details
                    </td>
                </tr>
                <tr class="row2">
                    <td class="HeaderStyle12" colspan="2">Disclaimer</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td colspan="2" class="disclaimer">
                        <input type="checkbox" id="chkdeclaration" class="chkdeclaration" />
                        I agree below terms & conditions:
                        <ul class="TERMSCONDITION">
                            <li>I here by declare that the details furnished above are true and correct to the best of my knowledge and belief and undertake to inform you of any changes therein, immediately.</li>
                            <li>All customer details, including GSTN,PAN number and Bank details etc., are cross-checked with the attached certificates.</li>
                        </ul>
                    </td>
                </tr>

                @*<tr>
                        <td class="collvlstyle">Next Approval :-</td>
                        <td>
                            <label id="lblnextapproval" class="lblcss" style="font-weight:bold">Finance Department</label>
                        </td>
                    </tr>*@
                <tr class="active">
                    <td colspan="2" align="center">

                        <button id="btnsubmit" type="button" class="vendorbtn">Submit</button>
                        &nbsp;&nbsp;
                        <!-- btncancelfrm -->
                        <button id="btncancelfrm" type="button" class="vendorbtn">Cancel</button>

                    </td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td colspan="2" align="center">
                        <span id="lblSuccessMsg" style="color:green"></span>
                        <span id="lblErrMsg" style="color:red"></span>
                    </td>
                </tr>
            </table>


        </div>
    </div>
    <div style="margin-left: 0.8em; margin-right: 0.8em; padding: 4px; margin-bottom:1em;" class="well well-sm">
        <table border="0" style="width: 100%;">
            <tr>
                <td style="height: 20px;">
                    <table style="width: 100%;">
                        <tbody>
                            <tr>
                                <td style="width: 20px; vertical-align: middle; text-align: center;">
                                    <a title="Back" href="../Home/Home">
                                        <img src="../images/icon_back.gif" border="0" alt="" />
                                    </a>
                                </td>
                                <td style="vertical-align: middle; font-size: 15px;">
                                    <span><a title="Back" href="../Home/Home">Back</a></span>
                                </td>
                            </tr>
                        </tbody>
                    </table>
                </td>
            </tr>
        </table>
    </div>
    <div class="ajaxLoader"></div>
</body>
</html>